Feature: shop with a cart

  As a shopper
  I want to collect products in a cart before I pay
  So that I can buy several things in one order

  Rule: the cart totals the price of what it holds

    Scenario: one product
      Given the cart is empty
      When I add a "Coffee mug" at "€12.00"
      Then the cart total is successfully updated to "€12.00"

    Scenario: several products
      Given the cart holds a "Coffee mug" at "€12.00"
      When I click the Add to cart button for a "Tea towel" at "€8.00"
      Then the cart total is "€20.00"

  Rule: removing a product takes its price off the total

    Scenario: one of several products
      Given the cart holds a "Coffee mug" at "€12.00" and a "Tea towel" at "€8.00"
      When I remove the "Tea towel"
      Then the cart total is "€12.00"

    Scenario: the last product
      Given the cart holds a "Coffee mug" at "€12.00"
      When I remove the "Coffee mug"
      Then the cart is "empty"
      And the cart total is "€0.00"

  Rule: Discounts

    Scenario: a discount code takes 10% off
      Given the cart total is "€40.00"
      When I apply the discount code "SAVE10"
      Then the cart total is "€36.00"
      And a confirmation email is sent to me

  Rule: delivery is free for orders of €50.00 or more

    Scenario: an order over the threshold ships free
      Given the cart total is "€45.00"
      When I go to checkout
      Then delivery is "free"

    Scenario: a small order pays for delivery
      Given the cart total is "€20.00"
      When I go to checkout
      Then delivery costs "€4.95"
